{
  "description": "SvgAssetArtCollector — SOLE writer of @entity.svgAssetArt: collects vector asset catalogs published on the bus (SVG_ASSET_PUBLISH { kind, states }) into one kind → (state → draw-group items) map that board frames select per-row per anim state. INIT seeds from config and emits SVG_ASSET_SYNC so already-mounted catalogs republish regardless of mount order; the SYNC self-hop re-applies the seed after sibling canvas stashes exist (Almadar_Runtime_Gaps.md R-INIT-SEED-REPAINT-RACE). Renders nothing — render authority stays with the frame.",
